ntial on awarded contracts reaching $1.85 billion, and an identified pipeline now exceeding $11.5 billion, the opportunity in front of us is substantial.","context":"* See definition and reconciliation of Adjusted EBITDA to net loss under “Non-GAAP Financial Measures” and “Reconciliation of GAAP to Non-GAAP Measures.”","section":"","block":7,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001628280-26-056704","form":"8-K","filedAt":"2026-08-13","reportDate":"2026-08-13","cik":"0002086587","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2086587/000162828026056704/pressreleaseq22026.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/511a26e608595c1358283c42e26707e366471a04fe1aa34a29d3020f8d513b7d.bin","sha256":"511a26e608595c1358283c42e26707e366471a04fe1aa34a29d3020f8d513b7d"}},{"id":"967c387e259e9befd8fd3fb7e0d145f017d7fc7addf0f42ff569144d7a4cc36f","quote":"Backlog stood at $592.0 million on June 30, down 8% from $642.3 million on March 31, and up 9% from the start of the year.","context":"Gross Margin increased 13 percentage points to 24%; Gross Profit was $22.2 million, up from $9.5 million in the year-ago quarter. The improvement in gross margin is largely attributable to the rolling off of a negative EAC adjustment last year.","section":"","block":14,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001628280-26-056704","form":"8-K","filedAt":"2026-08-13","reportDate":"2026-08-13","cik":"0002086587","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2086587/000162828026056704/pressreleaseq22026.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/511a26e608595c1358283c42e26707e366471a04fe1aa34a29d3020f8d513b7d.bin","sha256":"511a26e608595c1358283c42e26707e366471a04fe1aa34a29d3020f8d513b7d"}},{"id":"8f9e6efcca504e4b0f71c0ebcef1238ee6c3999b843ad9d7fbce86857db5fb98","quote":"This press release and the related conference call contain “forward-looking statements” w